skin rash pre-existing

547
00:22:54,110 --> 00:22:57,010
the other ocular signs
that we might see.

548
00:22:57,130 --> 00:23:00,450
So we do a very careful
eye exam for these

549
00:23:00,450 --> 00:23:02,610
patients, and we
typically give them oral

550
00:23:02,610 --> 00:23:06,010
antivirals for at
least 10 days, although

551
00:23:06,010 --> 00:23:09,550
