usually give a topical

553
00:23:11,310 --> 00:23:14,230
antibiotic ointment.
Some patients might need

554
00:23:14,230 --> 00:23:18,050
steroids, either
topical, oral, or IV. And

555
00:23:18,050 --> 00:23:21,470
unfortunately, this
condition can cause severe

556
00:23:21,470 --> 00:23:23,750
neuropathic pain,
and they may end up

557
00:23:23,750 --> 00:23:26,230
